OptionValue UH_ItemDesc
{
  0, "Opens a random Pandora item ranging\nfrom helpful tools to chaotic curses."
  1, "Calls down an explosive airstrike\nbarrage on the target area."
  2, "Fires a rocket projectile; Sharp\ndeals lethal piercing damage."
  3, "Spawns a hostile Demoneye or Mini-Vile\nhazard from the box."
  4, "Places an explosive brick mine trap\non the floor."
  5, "Summons an ice hazard (Ice Wall,\nIce Wave, or Chill Spike)."
  6, "Summons a swarm of hostile crows\nto harass nearby enemies."
  7, "Deploys a mini turret toy that fires\nfire/ice/laser shots at foes."
  8, "Flips a coin for a random blessing\nor heavy backlash."
  9, "Forces you to slowly lose health and\ndramatically self-destruct."
  10, "Drops bait that transforms victims\ninto Demoneyes."
  11, "Sets yourself ablaze, burning nearby\nfoes and draining HP. Ice hits\nreduce 1 stack."
  12, "Deploys instant-kill floor spikes or\nflings nearby players away."
  13, "High-jump mobility bounce pad or\ncontraband grapple hook."
  14, "Teleports and banishes targets across\nthe arena."
  15, "Unleashes beam blasts or splashes\ncursed water hazards."
  16, "Releases an aggressive swarm of\nhoming wasps."
  17, "Chance to instantly slay a target\nbased on missing health."
  18, "Spawns a random classic Mega Man\ncoop enemy onto the field."
  19, "Opens a high-tier Mystic item with\npowerful buffs or deadly chaos."
  20, "Grants temporary comedic protection\nand knockback resistance."
  21, "Unleashes a massive swarm of bees\nthat chase down enemies."
  22, "Boosts movement speed and fire rate\nfor a burst of momentum."
  23, "Grants brief total invulnerability\nand contact damage."
  24, "Throws a firebomb that ignites the\nfloor and burns targets."
  25, "Explodes in a wide radius, morphing\ncaught players into Demoneyes."
  26, "Restores health and grants a hefty\nprotective boost."
  27, "An amplified Give Up Hope that\ncauses catastrophic self-destruction."
  28, "Launches a chaotic bouncing football\nthat knocks players around."
  29, "Grants a powerful random wish effect\nsuch as healing or runes."
  30, "Fires unpredictable elemental bursts\nwith unique kill effects."
  31, "Curses the target with an impending\ndoom countdown."
  32, "Rare super-box granting game-changing\nitems and revivals."
  33, "Calls a wide carpet-bombing run\nacross the battlefield."
  34, "Equips an overpowered rapid-fire\ngun for a limited time."
  35, "Revives a fallen player after the\nconfigured delay, or grants Mortis\nBlessing if picked up."
  36, "Spawns an elite swarm of lethal\ngolden wasps."
  37, "Triggers a chaotic victory-style\neffect on the user."
  38, "Supercharges speed, jump, and energy\nfor extreme mobility."
  39, "Summons a motivated plastic chair\nwith defensive aura."
  40, "Protects you from one lethal hit,\nrestoring health and brief invuln."
  41, "Splashes targets with a debuff that\nincreases damage taken."
  42, "Transforms a survivor into their\nupgraded Shiny / True Power form."
  43, "Strength (2x dmg), Rage (2x fire rate),\nDrain (lifesteal), Spread (3x shots),\nResistance (half dmg), Regen, Haste,\nHighJump, Prosperity, Reflection,\nEndlessAmmo."
}
